    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> War sphere, channel energy class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you use your channel energy feature, instead of affecting everyone in a specific radius, you may spend a spell point to have it affect all allies or all enemies in a totem you control. You do not need to be within the chosen totem.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/channeling-feats#toc12\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
